      "question_type": "MCQ",
      "question_text": "The compound with molecular formula $\\text{C}_{20}\\text{H}_{42}$ is",
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-body\"> <div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->The compound with molecular formula  $\\text{C}_{20}\\text{H}_{42}$  is<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></div>",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "Decane",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Decane<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "Dodecane",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Dodecane<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "Eicosane",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Eicosane<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "Hicosane",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Hicosane<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "C",
      "explanation_text": "The molecular formula is $\\text{C}_{20}\\text{H}_{42}$ . For alkanes, the general formula is $\\text{C}_{n}\\text{H}_{2n+2}$ Here, $n=20$ . So, $\\text{H}=2(20)+2=42$ Hence the compound is an alkane with $20$ carbon atoms. The alkane with $20$ carbon atoms is called Eicosane . So, the correct option is Option C: Eicosane .",
      "explanation_html": "<div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><p>The molecular formula is  $\\text{C}_{20}\\text{H}_{42}$ .</p>\n<p>For alkanes, the general formula is</p>\n<p> $\\text{C}_{n}\\text{H}_{2n+2}$ </p>\n<p>Here,  $n=20$ .</p>\n<p>So,</p>\n<p> $\\text{H}=2(20)+2=42$ </p>\n<p>Hence the compound is an alkane with  $20$  carbon atoms.</p>\n<p>The alkane with  $20$  carbon atoms is called <strong>Eicosane</strong>.</p>\n<p>So, the correct option is <strong>Option C: Eicosane</strong>.</p><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>",
